1,0,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""VILLAGER"",""alive"":true}"
2,0,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""POSSESSED"",""alive"":true}"
3,0,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""SEER"",""alive"":true}"
4,0,,status,Shion,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello everyone. It is a pleasure to meet you all. I hope we can have a calm and thoughtful discussion to find the werewolf. I look forward to hearing your thoughts.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to meet you all as well. Let us be kind to one another as we work together to keep our village safe. I am looking forward to our conversation.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Let's keep this efficient. We need to identify the werewolf and the possessed as quickly as possible. I suggest we focus on any inconsistencies in behavior once the first night's results are in.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm excited to play with you all! Let's do our best to find the werewolf together. I'll be watching everyone closely to help the village win!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Efficiency is fine, Asuka, but rushing leads to mistakes. I'll be observing how each of you handles the pressure. Let's see who among us is actually capable of logical reasoning.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Shion. A measured approach is often more reliable than a rushed one. Let us observe each other's reactions and listen carefully to the arguments that emerge.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is wonderful to see such a thoughtful start. Let us remember to listen with open hearts. I believe that by trusting one another and staying patient, we will find the right path forward.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Trust is a luxury we cannot afford in this game, Shizue. While patience has its place, we must remain vigilant. I will be analyzing the voting patterns and claims starting tomorrow.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,I think we can be careful and fast at the same time! I'll do my part to help us figure this out. Does anyone have a plan for who we should keep an eye on first?,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, asking for a target this early is a bit premature, don't you think? It's more interesting to see who tries too hard to lead the conversation. I'll be watching for those overeager patterns.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,It seems we are all settling into our roles. I believe it is best to let the first night pass and see what information the Seer might bring to light before we form any strong suspicions.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree with Jonathan. There is no need to worry ourselves too much today. Let us all have a peaceful evening and hope for a helpful revelation tomorrow morning.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"I agree that we have no concrete data yet. However, I will be noting who is attempting to steer the group toward complacency. A peaceful evening is fine, provided we don't let our guard down.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not trying to be complacent, Asuka! I just want us all to get along while we solve the mystery. I'll be thinking hard about how to help everyone tonight!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, your obsession with ""data"" is almost predictable. It's a convenient shield for someone who wants to appear objective. I'm more interested in the emotional gaps in your logic. This is becoming quite amusing.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,It is a shame to see tension rising so quickly. Let us maintain our composure and enter the first night with a clear mind. I wish you all a restful evening.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"Thank you, Jonathan. Let us all try to be gentle with one another, even when we disagree. I wish you all a very peaceful night. Sleep well, everyone.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Asuka,,"I will be resting, but I will not be complacent. I expect the Seer to provide clear information tomorrow. Good night.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"Good night, everyone! I'll do my absolute best to find a clue tonight. See you all tomorrow morning!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Shion,,Good night. I'll be dreaming of the interesting masks you'll all wear tomorrow. Try not to be too predictable; it would make this game far too boring for me.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,,action,Kenji,Shion,WEREWOLF,"{""action"":""divine"",""result"":""WEREWOLF"",""valid"":true,""raw"":""Shion""}"
26,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""VILLAGER"",""alive"":true}"
27,1,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""VILLAGER"",""alive"":true}"
28,1,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""POSSESSED"",""alive"":true}"
29,1,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""SEER"",""alive"":true}"
30,1,,status,Shion,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all slept well. Now that the first night has passed, I wonder if the Seer has discovered anything that might guide our discussion today.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all had a restful sleep. I agree with Jonathan; if our Seer has found a clue, it would be a wonderful way to start our day.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"If the Seer has a confirmed human or werewolf, now is the time to speak. Hiding information only benefits the werewolf. @Seer, if you have a result, please share it so we can analyze it logically.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm the Seer! I checked on Shion last night, and it turns out Shion is the werewolf! We found them right away! Everyone, we have to vote for Shion today to save the village!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, that was far too fast. Claiming the Seer role and pointing a finger immediately is a classic move for a Werewolf trying to force a quick execution. Your eagerness is practically screaming guilt.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"This is quite a sudden development. @Kenji, your confidence is striking, but @Shion makes a fair point about the timing. It is difficult to know who to trust when such a strong accusation is made so quickly.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, this is quite a shock for our first morning. @Kenji, @Shion, please try to stay calm. It is very distressing to see such a strong disagreement so early. Does anyone else have any thoughts on this?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, your claim is direct, but @Shion's counter-argument is logically sound. A real Seer often hesitates to reveal themselves immediately to avoid being targeted. Why were you so eager to claim and accuse in the first turn?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, I just wanted to help everyone as soon as possible! Why wait when we already know who the bad guy is? I'm not lying, I really saw it! Please, believe me!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, your desperation is showing. ""Please believe me"" is the plea of a liar, not a Seer. You're trying to use emotion to bypass logic. @Asuka, @Jonathan, look at how he's panicking. It's quite pathetic.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Asuka"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It is indeed a difficult position. While Kenji's enthusiasm is helpful in spirit, the intensity of his plea does feel somewhat unsettling. I find myself wondering if we are seeing a genuine Seer or a very eager Werewolf.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is heartbreaking to see such a conflict. @Kenji, your heart seems so full of a desire to help, but @Shion's words are making me feel a bit uneasy. Perhaps we can all take a deep breath and think carefully.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, your emotional appeal doesn't provide evidence. If you are the Seer, you are risking your life for a result that we can't verify. @Shion, your composure is noted, but it could also be a calculated act. I'm leaning toward Kenji being the werewolf.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, I'm not panicking, I'm just sad you don't believe me! I'm telling the truth! If you vote for me, the werewolf wins! Please, look at Shion's mean words—they're just trying to trick you all!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, your ""sadness"" is a transparent attempt to manipulate the group's empathy. It's a clumsy performance. @Asuka, you've seen through the facade. The logic is simple: the most desperate person in the room is usually the one lying.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"It seems the consensus is shifting toward Kenji. While I dislike the tension, the logic presented by Asuka and Shion is difficult to ignore. @Kenji, your passion is noted, but it may be working against you.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"It is so sad to see everyone turning against Kenji. I truly hope there has been a misunderstanding. However, we must do what is best for the village. I will think carefully before I cast my vote.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"The evidence is circumstantial, but Kenji's behavior is highly inconsistent with a strategic Seer. His desperation is a red flag. Unless Shion can provide a reason for this attack, I believe Kenji is the werewolf. I'm voting for Kenji.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, @Jonathan, please don't! I'm not acting! I'm the Seer and I'm telling you the truth! If you vote for me, Shion will just kill more of us tonight! Please, believe me and vote for Shion!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Jonathan"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, your pleas are becoming a monotonous loop. You've provided nothing but noise and emotion. The village deserves a logical conclusion, and the most logical choice is to remove the source of this chaos. Vote for Kenji.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
