63,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a tragedy that we lost Kenji, and an even greater one that Asuka has been taken from us. This suggests that the werewolf is still among us, hiding behind a mask of logic.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"My heart is heavy with such sad news. Poor Kenji, and dear Asuka as well. It is truly frightening to realize the werewolf is still with us. We must stay strong and support each other in these difficult times.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Shion,,"It's a predictable outcome. Asuka was the most analytical among us; the werewolf naturally targeted the biggest threat to their deception. Now that the ""logic"" she championed is gone, we must be even more careful.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, your observation is astute. However, it also means the werewolf is now more dangerous, as they have successfully removed a sharp mind. We must be very cautious about who we trust now.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"I agree with Jonathan. It is very worrying that we have lost two of our friends so quickly. @Shion, you are very calm, but I wonder if we are all being too trusting. What do you think we should do now?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, trust is a gamble, not a strategy. We are down to three people. If we execute the wrong person today, the werewolf wins. We must analyze the remaining patterns coldly. @Jonathan, you've been very passive. What's your conclusion?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I have simply been observing, Shion. In a group of three, the tension is palpable. If you are human, then the werewolf must be Shizue or myself. Given the circumstances, I find it hard to cast a stone.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"Oh, Jonathan, please do not feel so conflicted. It is a very frightening position for all of us to be in. I only wish we could all be honest with one another so we could find peace again.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, ""honesty"" is a vague concept in a game of deception. @Jonathan, your hesitation is a weakness the werewolf can exploit. If you can't decide, you're essentially handing the victory to the enemy. Who among us has been the most invisible?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, invisibility can be a sign of peace or a sign of guilt. However, your insistence on a ""cold analysis"" while we are so few is quite pressing. I fear we are rushing toward a mistake.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"I feel so uneasy. Shion, you are pushing us to decide so quickly, and it makes me worry. Jonathan, please, let us think together. I truly hope we can find the truth without losing anyone else.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, your unease is merely a reaction to the pressure of the situation. @Jonathan, hesitation is not caution; it is paralysis. If we don't act decisively, we've already lost. The most logical target is the one hiding behind kindness.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
